{"seq":2,"slug":"auto-scaling","title":"自动伸缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/devops-sre/capacity-planning/auto-scaling","wordCount":1234,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"自动伸缩\">自动伸缩</h1><h2 id=\"为什么需要自动伸缩\">为什么需要自动伸缩</h2><p>在传统模式下，容量规划依赖人工预判和手动调整。但云原生环境的流量波动更加频繁和剧烈——日常业务有明显的峰谷周期，营销活动可能带来数倍的流量突增。自动伸缩（Auto Scaling）让系统能够根据实时负载动态调整资源，实现&quot;按需使用、按需付费&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[流量波动] --&gt; B[自动伸缩]&#10;    B --&gt; C[高峰扩容: 保障性能]&#10;    B --&gt; D[低谷缩容: 节省成本]\">graph LR\n    A[流量波动] --&gt; B[自动伸缩]\n    B --&gt; C[高峰扩容: 保障性能]\n    B --&gt; D[低谷缩容: 节省成本]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自动伸缩（Auto Scaling）让系统根据实时负载动态调整资源，实现&quot;按需使用、按需付费&quot;。理解它需要先厘清一组基本术语。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>在本主题中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动伸缩</td>\n<td>依据实时负载动态调整资源</td>\n<td>本主题的核心对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HPA</td>\n<td>水平 Pod 自动伸缩，调整副本数</td>\n<td>最常用的伸缩方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VPA</td>\n<td>垂直 Pod 自动伸缩，调整资源限制</td>\n<td>调整单 Pod 的规格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cluster Autoscaler</td>\n<td>集群节点自动伸缩，调整节点数</td>\n<td>为 Pod 提供可调度容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KEDA</td>\n<td>基于外部事件（如队列深度）的伸缩</td>\n<td>事件驱动场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伸缩策略</td>\n<td>扩容/缩容的触发条件与冷却时间</td>\n<td>防止抖动与震荡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>自动伸缩的前提是负载可观测：HPA 依据指标（CPU、自定义指标）调整副本，VPA 调整单 Pod 规格，Cluster Autoscaler 增减节点，KEDA 则把伸缩信号扩展到消息队列等外部事件。合理的冷却时间与稳定窗口可避免频繁抖动。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"kubernetes-自动伸缩体系\">Kubernetes 自动伸缩体系</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Kubernetes 自动伸缩] --&gt; B[HPA&lt;br/&gt;水平 Pod 自动伸缩]&#10;    A --&gt; C[VPA&lt;br/&gt;垂直 Pod 自动伸缩]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Cluster Autoscaler&lt;br/&gt;集群节点自动伸缩]&#10;    A --&gt; E[KEDA&lt;br/&gt;事件驱动自动伸缩]&#10;    B --&gt; F[调整 Pod 副本数]&#10;    C --&gt; G[调整 Pod 资源限制]&#10;    D --&gt; H[调整集群节点数]&#10;    E --&gt; I[基于外部事件伸缩]\">graph TD\n    A[Kubernetes 自动伸缩] --&gt; B[HPA&lt;br/&gt;水平 Pod 自动伸缩]\n    A --&gt; C[VPA&lt;br/&gt;垂直 Pod 自动伸缩]\n    A --&gt; D[Cluster Autoscaler&lt;br/&gt;集群节点自动伸缩]\n    A --&gt; E[KEDA&lt;br/&gt;事件驱动自动伸缩]\n    B --&gt; F[调整 Pod 副本数]\n    C --&gt; G[调整 Pod 资源限制]\n    D --&gt; H[调整集群节点数]\n    E --&gt; I[基于外部事件伸缩]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"hpa-水平-pod-自动伸缩\">HPA（水平 Pod 自动伸缩）</h2><h3 id=\"工作原理\">工作原理</h3><p>HPA 通过监控 Pod 的指标（CPU、内存或自定义指标），自动调整 Deployment 的副本数：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant HPA as HPA Controller&#10;    participant MS as Metrics Server&#10;    participant D as Deployment&#10;&#10;    loop 每 15 秒&#10;        HPA-&gt;&gt;MS: 查询当前 Pod 指标&#10;        MS--&gt;&gt;HPA: 返回 CPU/内存/自定义指标&#10;        HPA-&gt;&gt;HPA: 计算期望副本数&#10;        HPA-&gt;&gt;D: 调整副本数(如需要)&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant HPA as HPA Controller\n    participant MS as Metrics Server\n    participant D as Deployment\n\n    loop 每 15 秒\n        HPA-&gt;&gt;MS: 查询当前 Pod 指标\n        MS--&gt;&gt;HPA: 返回 CPU/内存/自定义指标\n        HPA-&gt;&gt;HPA: 计算期望副本数\n        HPA-&gt;&gt;D: 调整副本数(如需要)\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"计算公式\">计算公式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"期望副本数 = ceil(当前副本数 × (当前指标值 / 目标指标值))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>期望副本数 = ceil(当前副本数 × (当前指标值 / 目标指标值))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>例如：当前 3 个 Pod，平均 CPU 利用率 80%，目标 50%：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"期望副本数 = ceil(3 × (80/50)) = ceil(4.8) = 5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>期望副本数 = ceil(3 × (80/50)) = ceil(4.8) = 5</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"hpa-配置\">HPA 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: autoscaling/v2&#10;kind: HorizontalPodAutoscaler&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: web-app-hpa&#10;spec:&#10;  scaleTargetRef:&#10;    apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;    kind: Deployment&#10;    name: web-app&#10;  minReplicas: 3&#10;  maxReplicas: 20&#10;  metrics:&#10;    - type: Resource&#10;      resource:&#10;        name: cpu&#10;        target:&#10;          type: Utilization&#10;          averageUtilization: 60&#10;    - type: Resource&#10;      resource:&#10;        name: memory&#10;        target:&#10;          type: Utilization&#10;          averageUtilization: 75&#10;    - type: Pods&#10;      pods:&#10;        metric:&#10;          name: http_requests_per_second&#10;        target:&#10;          type: AverageValue&#10;          averageValue: &#39;1000&#39;&#10;  behavior:&#10;    scaleUp:&#10;      stabilizationWindowSeconds: 60&#10;      policies:&#10;        - type: Pods&#10;          value: 4&#10;          periodSeconds: 60&#10;        - type: Percent&#10;          value: 100&#10;          periodSeconds: 60&#10;      selectPolicy: Max&#10;    scaleDown:&#10;      stabilizationWindowSeconds: 300&#10;      policies:&#10;        - type: Pods&#10;          value: 2&#10;          periodSeconds: 60\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">autoscaling/v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">HorizontalPodAutoscaler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web-app-hpa</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  scaleTargetRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  minReplicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  maxReplicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Resource</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      resource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cpu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Utilization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          averageUtilization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Resource</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      resource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">memory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Utilization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          averageUtilization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">75</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pods</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      pods</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http_requests_per_second</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">AverageValue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          averageValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1000'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  behavior</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    scaleUp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      stabilizationWindowSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      policies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pods</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Percent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      selectPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Max</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    scaleDown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      stabilizationWindowSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      policies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pods</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"hpa-参数说明\">HPA 参数说明</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>建议值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>minReplicas</td>\n<td>最小副本数</td>\n<td>&gt;= 3（保证高可用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>maxReplicas</td>\n<td>最大副本数</td>\n<td>根据预算和容量上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>targetCPU</td>\n<td>目标 CPU 利用率</td>\n<td>50%-70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>stabilizationWindow</td>\n<td>缩容稳定窗口</td>\n<td>300-600 秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>scaleUp policy</td>\n<td>扩容策略</td>\n<td>快速扩容（60 秒内倍增）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>scaleDown policy</td>\n<td>缩容策略</td>\n<td>缓慢缩容（每分钟最多减 2 个）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"vpa-垂直-pod-自动伸缩\">VPA（垂直 Pod 自动伸缩）</h2><p>VPA 自动调整 Pod 的 CPU 和内存的 requests/limits，而不是调整副本数：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[VPA Recommender] --&gt; B[分析 Pod 历史资源使用]&#10;    B --&gt; C[生成资源建议]&#10;    C --&gt; D{更新模式?}&#10;    D --&gt;|Auto| E[自动重建 Pod 应用新资源]&#10;    D --&gt;|Initial| F[仅新建 Pod 使用建议]&#10;    D --&gt;|Off| G[仅生成建议不执行]\">graph LR\n    A[VPA Recommender] --&gt; B[分析 Pod 历史资源使用]\n    B --&gt; C[生成资源建议]\n    C --&gt; D{更新模式?}\n    D --&gt;|Auto| E[自动重建 Pod 应用新资源]\n    D --&gt;|Initial| F[仅新建 Pod 使用建议]\n    D --&gt;|Off| G[仅生成建议不执行]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: autoscaling.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: VerticalPodAutoscaler&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: web-app-vpa&#10;spec:&#10;  targetRef:&#10;    apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;    kind: Deployment&#10;    name: web-app&#10;  updatePolicy:&#10;    updateMode: &#39;Auto&#39;&#10;  resourcePolicy:&#10;    containerPolicies:&#10;      - containerName: app&#10;        minAllowed:&#10;          cpu: 100m&#10;          memory: 128Mi&#10;        maxAllowed:&#10;          cpu: 2000m&#10;          memory: 4Gi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">autoscaling.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VerticalPodAutoscaler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web-app-vpa</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  targetRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  updatePolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    updateMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Auto'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  resourcePolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    containerPolicies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">containerName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        minAllowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">100m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">128Mi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        maxAllowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2000m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">4Gi</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"hpa-vs-vpa\">HPA vs VPA</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>HPA</th>\n<th>VPA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>伸缩维度</td>\n<td>水平（副本数）</td>\n<td>垂直（单 Pod 资源）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无状态服务</td>\n<td>适合</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有状态服务</td>\n<td>谨慎（需考虑数据）</td>\n<td>更适合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>突发流量</td>\n<td>快速响应</td>\n<td>响应较慢（需重建 Pod）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兼容性</td>\n<td>可与 VPA 共存（限制）</td>\n<td>不建议与 HPA 同时管理相同指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"keda-事件驱动自动伸缩\">KEDA（事件驱动自动伸缩）</h2><p>KEDA 扩展了 K8s 的自动伸缩能力，支持基于外部事件源（消息队列、数据库、HTTP 请求等）进行伸缩：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[外部事件源] --&gt; B[KEDA Scaler]&#10;    B --&gt; C[KEDA Controller]&#10;    C --&gt; D[HPA]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Deployment]&#10;    A --&gt; F[Kafka Topic 积压]&#10;    A --&gt; G[RabbitMQ 队列深度]&#10;    A --&gt; H[Redis Stream 长度]&#10;    A --&gt; I[Prometheus 自定义指标]\">graph LR\n    A[外部事件源] --&gt; B[KEDA Scaler]\n    B --&gt; C[KEDA Controller]\n    C --&gt; D[HPA]\n    D --&gt; E[Deployment]\n    A --&gt; F[Kafka Topic 积压]\n    A --&gt; G[RabbitMQ 队列深度]\n    A --&gt; H[Redis Stream 长度]\n    A --&gt; I[Prometheus 自定义指标]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: keda.sh/v1alpha1&#10;kind: ScaledObject&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: order-processor&#10;spec:&#10;  scaleTargetRef:&#10;    name: order-processor&#10;  pollingInterval: 15&#10;  cooldownPeriod: 300&#10;  minReplicaCount: 1&#10;  maxReplicaCount: 50&#10;  triggers:&#10;    - type: kafka&#10;      metadata:&#10;        bootstrapServers: kafka:9092&#10;        consumerGroup: order-group&#10;        topic: orders&#10;        lagThreshold: &#39;100&#39;&#10;    - type: prometheus&#10;      metadata:&#10;        serverAddress: http://prometheus:9090&#10;        metricName: order_processing_queue_size&#10;        threshold: &#39;50&#39;&#10;        query: |&#10;          sum(order_processing_queue_size)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"